### ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
### Session 1 - basic reads
### Open this file in VS Code / BAS with the "REST Client" extension
### and click "Send Request" above each request. Run `cds watch` first.
### ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

@server = http://localhost:4004

### Service document - lists all entity sets
GET {{server}}/odata/v4/vendor/

### Service metadata (EDMX) - the OData "contract", similar to a WSDL
GET {{server}}/odata/v4/vendor/$metadata

### All vendors
GET {{server}}/odata/v4/vendor/Vendors

### One vendor by key
GET {{server}}/odata/v4/vendor/Vendors(a1b2c3d4-0000-0000-0000-000000000001)

### Vendors with their contacts (deep read via composition)
GET {{server}}/odata/v4/vendor/Vendors?$expand=contacts

### Filter + select + order
GET {{server}}/odata/v4/vendor/Vendors?$filter=status eq 'Active'&$select=name,country&$orderby=name
